    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 10th level, you are able to draw on the tranquil nature around you to sooth your allies. As an action, you evoke the tranquility and gain a pool of healing energy that can restore hit points equal to five times your druid level.</p><p>Maintaining tranquility requires your concentration, lasts up to 1 minute, and while you are concentrating on it your movement speed is halved.</p><p>While active, you can use a bonus action to choose any number of creatures within 30 feet of you and divide a number of hit points from your pool among them, to a maximum number of hit points equals your druid level.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
